n to `1998`. `0.29` became `28` the same way. Every total built on those lines was off by a cent or more.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts through `Decimal(str(amount))` and rounds to whole cents with `ROUND_HALF_UP`. Prices with up to two decimals convert exactly. If a price has fractions of a cent, those now round half-up instead of being dropped, which matches how `discounts.py` and `tax.py` already round.\n\n**Running the tests:** plain `pytest` doesn't work in this environment. The local `pytest` is broken, and with `uvx` the tests can't import `ledger` unless the repo root is on the path. This command works:\n```\nPYTHONPATH=. uvx pytest -q tests\n```\nAdding a `conftest.py` or a `pythonpath` setting in the pytest config would make plain `pytest` work. I didn't add one because you only asked for the bug fix.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 131787, "requests_cache_write": 35538, "requests_cost_usd": 0.23773940000000002, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 1681, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial3", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 4, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T00:00:13.879091+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 23.686, "t_checker_s": 0.581, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1699, "tokens_cache_read": 131787, "tokens_cache_write": 35538, "tokens_fresh": 1699, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 131787, "tokens_main_cache_write": 35538, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 1681, "tokens_out